f3f3f0;padding:32px 25px;margin-top:35px}.lp-final h2{font-size:30px}.lp-article details{border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding:17px 0}.lp-article summary{cursor:pointer;font:700 15px/1.5 Arial}.lp-article details p{font-size:16px;margin:15px 0 0}footer{border-top:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;padding:28px 24px 40px;font-size:11px;line-height:2;color:#666}footer a{margin:0 9px}.lp-sticky{position:sticky;bottom:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,.96);border-top:1px solid #ddd;padding:10px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:25px;font:12px Arial;z-index:10}.lp-sticky .lp-button{margin:0;padding:12px 24px;font-size:12px}@media(max-width:600px){body{font-size:17px;line-height:1.75}.lp-nav{padding:20px}.lp-article{padding:28px 20px 50px}.lp-article h1{font-size:29px}.lp-article h2{font-size:26px}.lp-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lp-quote{font-size:24px}.lp-box{padding:21px}.lp-sticky>span{display:none}.lp-sticky .lp-button{width:100%}.lp-lead{font-size:19px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}</style>{{ content_for_header }}</head><body><div class="lp-top">BLK_MAJESTY JOURNAL · COMFORT, CONSIDERED</div><nav class="lp-nav" aria-label="Main"><a class="lp-brand" href="https://blkmajesty.shop/">BLK_MAJESTY</a><a href="https://blkmajesty.shop/products/culotte-post-patrum">Explore the briefs &rarr;</a></nav><main class="lp-article"><div class="lp-kicker">Motherhood &amp; everyday comfort</div><div class="lp-breadcrumb">Home &rsaquo; Journal &rsaquo; Finding your fit</div><h1>Your body has changed.<br>Getting dressed can still feel like you.</h1><div class="lp-meta"><div class="lp-avatar" aria-hidden="true">BM</div><div><strong>BLK_MAJESTY Journal</strong><br><span>A guide to choosing comfortable shaping underwear · Brand editorial</span></div></div><p class="lp-lead">Some mornings, it is the waistband. Other days, it is the dress that sits differently. Finding clothes you enjoy wearing starts with a foundation that feels right for you.</p><p>There is no deadline for feeling at home in your wardrobe. You can appreciate everything your body has done and still want a little extra support beneath your favourite outfit.</p><p>This guide is about that everyday choice: what to look for in a shaping brief, how to judge the fit, and how to make room for comfort.</p><figure><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0819/0882/6369/files/ADV-2.webp?v=1782598935" alt="Woman looking at her reflection" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy"><figcaption class="lp-caption">A familiar moment: choosing what feels good today.</figcaption></figure><div class="lp-box"><h3>Start with how you want to feel</h3><p>Comfortable sitting down. Supported as you move. At ease in the clothes you choose.</p><p>Those are useful goals for underwear. A number on a label does not tell the whole story.</p></div><section class="lp-section"><h2>One wardrobe. Different kinds of support.</h2><p>Ordinary briefs, shaping underwear and structured garments each have a different role. Before choosing, think about the outfit, the occasion and the sensation you prefer.</p><ul class="lp-list"><li><strong>For relaxed days:</strong> prioritise ease of movement and a waistband you barely notice.</li><li><strong>For a fitted outfit:</strong> consider where seams and edges sit beneath the fabric.</li><li><strong>For a longer day:</strong> test the fit while sitting, bending and walking, rather than only in front of a mirror.</li></ul><p>More pressure is not automatically a better fit. Your underwear should work with your day.</p><a class="lp-button" href="https://blkmajesty.shop/products/culotte-post-patrum">Explore your everyday foundation &rarr;</a><div class="lp-note">View available colours, sizes and current offers on the product page.</div></section><section class="lp-section"><h2>Look beyond the front view.</h2><div class="lp-quote">A good fit matters from every angle.</div><p>Check the waistband at the back, the edges around your hips and the way the fabric moves with you. A brief that looks right standing still should also feel comfortable when you take a seat.</p><p>The crossed panels on the BLK_MAJESTY brief create a distinctive wraparound construction. Pair that detail with a size that suits your measurements.</p></section><section class="lp-section"><h2>The appeal of a wrapped silhouette.</h2><p>Overlapping bands bring structure and visual definition to a simple garment. Here, that idea becomes a high-waist brief: easy to style, easy to layer and designed to be part of an everyday outfit.</p><p>Rather than adding another piece over your underwear, start with a foundation that combines the look and feel you want.</p></section><section class="lp-section" id="the-brief"><h2>Meet your BLK_MAJESTY foundation.</h2>{% assign landing_product = all_products['culotte-post-patrum'] %}{% if landing_product.featured_image %}<figure>{{ landing_product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: 'BLK_MAJESTY high-waist shaping brief' }}<figcaption class="lp-caption">BLK_MAJESTY high-waist shaping briefs.</figcaption></figure>{% endif %}<ul class="lp-list"><li><strong>A high-waist shape</strong> for coverage through the midsection.</li><li><strong>Crossed front panels</strong> that give the brief its signature construction.</li><li><strong>Mesh details</strong> integrated into the design.</li><li><strong>A choice of colours</strong> to complement your wardrobe.</li></ul><p>Start with the size guide on the product page. Available colours, sizes and pricing are shown there, so you can choose the option that suits you.</p><a class="lp-button" href="https://blkmajesty.shop/products/culotte-post-patrum">Find your colour and size &rarr;</a><div class="lp-note">View available colours, sizes and current offers on the product page.</div></section><section class="lp-section"><h2>Make the first wear a fit check.</h2><ol class="lp-steps"><li><strong>Choose with measurements.</strong>Use the product size guide rather than assuming your usual clothing size will match.</li><li><strong>Try your everyday movements.</strong>Sit, stand and bend. Notice the waistband, leg openings and how the garment settles.</li><li><strong>Layer your chosen outfit.</strong>Check the finish beneath the clothes you actually plan to wear.</li><li><strong>Let comfort decide.</strong>If it pinches or feels restrictive, reassess the size and style. A smaller size is not the goal.</li></ol></section><section class="lp-section"><h2>Build around your kind of day.</h2><div class="lp-grid"><div class="lp-card"><span class="lp-label">The everyday outfit</span><p>A favourite pair of jeans, a soft top and a foundation that feels comfortable when you sit.</p></div><div class="lp-card"><span class="lp-label">The occasion outfit</span><p>A dress you enjoy wearing, with underwear chosen to suit its fabric and cut.</p></div><div class="lp-card"><span class="lp-label">The working day</span><p>A fit checked for the commute, your desk and everything in between.</p></div><div class="lp-card"><span class="lp-label">The quieter day</span><p>Comfort on your terms. Choose the amount of structure that feels right today.</p></div></div></section><section class="lp-section"><h2>The details worth comparing.</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">What to check</th><th scope="col">What to look for</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Waist height</td><td>Coverage that works with your outfit.</td></tr><tr><td>Panel construction</td><td>A feel you enjoy across the front, hips and back.</td></tr><tr><td>Edges and seams</td><td>A finish suited to the fabric worn over them.</td></tr><tr><td>Movement</td><td>Comfort while seated as well as standing.</td></tr><tr><td>Size and colour</td><td>Current measurements and a shade that fits your wardrobe.</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section class="lp-section"><h2>A few questions before you choose.</h2><details><summary>Which size should I choose?</summary><p>Compare your measurements with the size guide on the product page. If you are between sizes or unsure, contact the store before ordering.</p></details><details><summary>Can I choose a different colour?</summary><p>Yes. Select from the colours currently available on the product page. Availability may vary by size.</p></details><details><summary>Is this a medical recovery garment?</summary><p>This page describes shaping underwear for everyday wear, not a medical treatment. For use after childbirth or surgery, ask your clinician whether and when this type of garment is suitable for you.</p></details><details><summary>Where can I find delivery and return details?</summary><p>Read the store’s shipping and refund policies before ordering. The checkout shows the delivery options for your address.</p></details></section><div class="lp-final"><div class="lp-kicker">YOUR WARDROBE. YOUR COMFORT.</div><h2>Find the foundation<br>that feels like you.</h2><p>Explore the high-waist shaping brief and choose your next everyday essential.</p><a class="lp-button" href="https://blkmajesty.shop/products/culotte-post-patrum">Shop BLK_MAJESTY &rarr;</a><div class="lp-note">View available colours, sizes and current offers on the product page.</div></div></main><footer><strong>BLK_MAJESTY</strong><br><a href="https://blkmajesty.shop/pages/contact">Contact</a><a href="https://blkmajesty.shop/policies/shipping-policy">Shipping</a><a href="https://blkmajesty.shop/policies/refund-policy">Returns</a><a href="https://blkmajesty.shop/policies/privacy-policy">Privacy</a><br>Brand editorial · Find your fit, at your own pace.</footer><div class="lp-sticky"><span>HIGH-WAIST SHAPING BRIEFS</span><a class="lp-button" href="https://blkmajesty.shop/products/culotte-post-patrum">Choose your colour &rarr;</a></div></body></html>